WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.582
Jack waited until the ogre left the room.

2
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:17.705
Then he threw open the oven door.

3
00:00:17.706 --> 00:00:19.922
He started to jump out.

4
00:00:19.923 --> 00:00:22.224
But the ogre's wife stopped him.

5
00:00:22.225 --> 00:00:29.772
"No!" she whispered. "It's not safe yet.

6
00:00:29.773 --> 00:00:31.827
You must wait.

7
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:36.657
My husband always takes a nap after breakfast."

8
00:00:36.658 --> 00:00:42.359
With a sigh, Jack closed the door.

9
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:49.632
Soon the ogre came back.

10
00:00:49.633 --> 00:01:10.601
From inside the oven, Jack watched.

11
00:01:10.602 --> 00:01:13.629
The ogre ate his big breakfast.

12
00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:27.750
"Mmm! Delicious," he said.

13
00:01:27.751 --> 00:01:31.354
Soon the ogre's plate was empty.

14
00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:42.220
"Whew. That was fast," Jack thought.

15
00:01:42.221 --> 00:01:45.953
"Wife," the ogre shouted.

16
00:01:45.954 --> 00:01:49.533
"Make me some more pancakes!"

17
00:01:49.534 --> 00:01:54.926
"Sure, dear," the ogre's wife said.

18
00:01:54.927 --> 00:01:59.782
"Ugh!" Jack thought. "This will take forever.

19
00:01:59.783 --> 00:02:06.483
I'll never escape from this oven."

20
00:02:06.484 --> 00:02:21.842
Jack waited while the ogre ate more pancakes.

21
00:02:21.843 --> 00:02:25.315
At last the ogre got to his feet.

22
00:02:25.316 --> 00:02:30.267
"Finally!" Jack thought. "Now he will take his nap."

23
00:02:30.268 --> 00:02:33.666
But the ogre didn't go to sleep.

24
00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:37.908
Instead he went over to a big wooden chest.

25
00:02:37.909 --> 00:02:41.428
"What's he doing now?" Jack thought.

26
00:02:41.429 --> 00:02:46.427
The ogre lifted the lid on the chest.

27
00:02:46.428 --> 00:02:48.708
He pulled out two bags.

28
00:02:48.709 --> 00:02:51.483
Jack's eyes opened wide.

29
00:02:51.484 --> 00:02:55.933
"That chest is filled with gold and treasure!" Jack thought.

30
00:02:55.934 --> 00:03:04.233
"And some of it belongs to Mother and me!"

